								<p class="text-ink-600 text-sm font-serif">
									Works in Astro frontmatter (Node/build time) and in Svelte components (browser/runtime).
									One dependency for SEO extraction and interactive playback — no environment-specific forks.
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="bg-parchment-100 border border-ink-200 p-5">
								<h4 class="font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-2">Multi-format, ~5kB</h4>
								<p class="text-ink-600 text-sm font-serif">
									Parses VTT, SRT, and SSA/ASS. TypeScript-native with proper <code class="font-mono text-xs">VTTCue</code> types.
									Tree-shakes to just the parser you use. Zero dependencies.
								</p>
							</div>
