							Top-level context provider that manages player state and coordinates all child components. Provides PlayerContext to children.
						</p>
						<div class="bg-parchment-100 rounded-lg p-4 border border-ink-200">
							<h4 class="font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-2">Props:</h4>
							<ul class="space-y-2 text-sm font-mono">
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">manifestUrl</span>: string - IIIF Presentation 3.0 manifest URL</li>
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">canvasIndex</span>?: number - Canvas to display (default: 0)</li>
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">initialTime</span>?: number - Start playback at specific time</li>
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">autoplay</span>?: boolean - Auto-play when ready (default: false)</li>
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">class</span>?: string - CSS class for the root wrapper</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- IIIFPlayer.Viewer -->
					<div class="border-l-4 border-terracotta-500 pl-6">
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-3">IIIFPlayer.Viewer</h3>
						<p class="text-ink-600 mb-4">
							Renders the IIIF media resource (video/audio) from the current canvas. Receives PlayerContext from Root.
						</p>
						<div class="bg-parchment-100 rounded-lg p-4 border border-ink-200">
							<h4 class="font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-2">Props:</h4>
							<ul class="space-y-2 text-sm font-mono">
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">controls</span>?: boolean - Show native browser controls (default: false)</li>
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">crossOrigin</span>?: 'anonymous' | 'use-credentials' - CORS setting for media</li>
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">class</span>?: string - CSS class for the media element</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- IIIFPlayer.Controls -->
					<div class="border-l-4 border-terracotta-500 pl-6">
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-3">IIIFPlayer.Controls</h3>
						<p class="text-ink-600 mb-4">
							Container for player control components. Use as layout wrapper for PlayButton, Progress, Skip, etc.
						</p>
						<div class="bg-parchment-100 rounded-lg p-4 border border-ink-200">
							<h4 class="font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-2">Child Components:</h4>
							<ul class="space-y-2 text-sm font-mono">
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">PlayButton</span> - Toggle play/pause</li>
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">Progress</span> - Seekable progress bar</li>
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">Skip</span> - Skip forward/back (seconds prop)</li>
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">Speed</span> - Playback speed selector</li>
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">Time</span> - Display current time and duration</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- IIIFPlayer.Transcript -->
					<div class="border-l-4 border-terracotta-500 pl-6">
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-3">IIIFPlayer.Transcript</h3>
						<p class="text-ink-600 mb-4">
							Bidirectional synchronized transcript panel. Click segment to seek, video auto-scrolls active segment. Compose with compound children for full control over layout.
						</p>
						<div class="bg-parchment-100 rounded-lg p-4 border border-ink-200">
							<h4 class="font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-2">Props:</h4>
							<ul class="space-y-2 text-sm font-mono">
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">annotations</span>: Annotation[] - Transcript segments with timing</li>
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">ariaLabel</span>?: string - Region aria-label (default: 'Media transcript')</li>
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">onActiveAnnotationChange</span>?: (annotation | null) => void - Active segment callback</li>
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">onSegmentClick</span>?: (annotation, event) => void - Click handler with preventDefault</li>
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">class</span>?: string - CSS class for the transcript region</li>
							</ul>
							<h4 class="font-semibold text-ink-900 mt-4 mb-2">Compound Children:</h4>
							<ul class="space-y-2 text-sm font-mono">
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">TranscriptSearch</span> - Search UI with match navigation</li>
								<li><span class="text-terracotta-600">TranscriptSegments</span> - Segment list with active/highlight states</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Custom Segment Snippets -->
					<div class="border-l-4 border-terracotta-500 pl-6">
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-3">Custom Segment Rendering</h3>
						<p class="text-ink-600 mb-4">
							Use the segment snippet to customize how transcript segments are rendered. Access annotation metadata for speakers, confidence scores, etc.
						</p>
						<div class="bg-parchment-200 border-2 border-ink-200 p-6">
							<pre class="text-sm font-mono overflow-x-auto text-ink-800"><code class="language-svelte">{`<IIIFPlayer.Transcript {annotations}>
  {#snippet segment({ annotation, isActive, onClick })}
    <button data-annotation-id={annotation.id} onclick={onClick}>
      {#if annotation.metadata?.speaker}
        <strong>{annotation.metadata.speaker}:</strong>
      {/if}
      <span class:active={isActive}>{annotation.text}</span>
    </button>
  {/snippet}
</IIIFPlayer.Transcript>`}</code></pre>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Styling Guide Section -->
		<section id="styling" class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
				<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-ink-900 mb-4">Styling Guide</h2>
				<p class="text-lg text-ink-600 mb-8">
					All components ship unstyled with data-* attributes. Here's a minimal example to get started.
				</p>

				<div class="space-y-8">
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-4">Transcript Segment Highlighting</h3>
						<div class="bg-parchment-50 rounded-lg p-6 border border-ink-200">
							<pre class="text-sm font-mono overflow-x-auto"><code class="language-css">{`/* Target transcript segments via data attributes */
button[data-annotation-id] {
  padding: 0.75rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  border-radius: 0.25rem;
  transition: background-color 0.2s;
  text-align: left;
}

button[data-annotation-id]:hover {
  background-color: #f3f4f6;
}

/* Active segment highlighting */
button[data-annotation-id][data-state='active'] {
  background-color: #bae6fd;
  border-left: 4px solid #0ea5e9;
}

/* Search match highlighting */
button[data-annotation-id][data-highlighted='true'] {
  background-color: #fef9c3;
}

/* Current search match (stronger) */
button[data-annotation-id][data-current-match='true'] {
  background-color: #fde68a;
  border-left: 4px solid #eab308;
}

button[data-annotation-id] .timestamp {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: #6b7280;
  font-weight: 600;
}

button[data-annotation-id] .text {
  color: #1f2937;
  line-height: 1.5;
}`}</code></pre>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div>
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-4">Audio Player Controls</h3>
						<div class="bg-parchment-50 rounded-lg p-6 border border-ink-200">
							<pre class="text-sm font-mono overflow-x-auto"><code class="language-css">{`/* Style control bar via data attributes */
[data-audio-controls] {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  padding: 1rem;
  background: white;
  border-radius: 0.5rem;
}

[data-audio-button] {
  padding: 0.5rem;
  background: #f3f4f6;
  border-radius: 0.25rem;
  transition: background-color 0.2s;
}

[data-audio-button]:hover {
  background: #e5e7eb;
}

/* Progress bar */
input[type="range"][data-audio-progress] {
  width: 100%;
  height: 0.5rem;
  cursor: pointer;
  accent-color: #0ea5e9;
}

/* Speed selector */
select[data-audio-control="speed"] {
  padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
  border-radius: 0.25rem;
}

/* Time display */
[data-audio-control="time"] {
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}`}</code></pre>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Footer -->
		<footer class="py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-ink-900 text-ink-400">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center">
				<p class="mb-4">
